{"4938200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snowed Under | 雪葬", "steam_appid": 4938200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snowed Under</strong> is a first-person game about shoveling snow in the mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig deeper and deeper through the snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you find buried beneath it? Food? Buildings? Or something else entirely…?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened in this place? What is about to happen? And what will you think when you uncover the truth…?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Play Time:</strong> 2–4 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Snow Shoveling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through the snow and make your way toward the steel tower. Keep moving forward. Keep digging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/1f6aace49ddd3a47ee3e08ec049db4ed.poster.avif?t=1786669597\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/1f6aace49ddd3a47ee3e08ec049db4ed.webm?t=1786669597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/1f6aace49ddd3a47ee3e08ec049db4ed.mp4?t=1786669597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Shovel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use scrap materials found beneath the snow to upgrade your shovel and improve your digging efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/1d9a029033efc60ac473d6db9e2c49bf.poster.avif?t=1786669597\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/1d9a029033efc60ac473d6db9e2c49bf.webm?t=1786669597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/1d9a029033efc60ac473d6db9e2c49bf.mp4?t=1786669597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Landmarks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig onward, you will reach various buildings buried in the snow. What waits inside them…?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/016e7399333967f2de593e065e396b54.poster.avif?t=1786669597\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/016e7399333967f2de593e065e396b54.webm?t=1786669597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/016e7399333967f2de593e065e396b54.mp4?t=1786669597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conversations with Kai</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days pass, your conversations with Kai, your friend, will continue to unfold. <br>What is Kai thinking? And what does the protagonist begin to feel?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/78c251202bb5a84f8b177c300b66e6c5.poster.avif?t=1786669597\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/78c251202bb5a84f8b177c300b66e6c5.webm?t=1786669597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/78c251202bb5a84f8b177c300b66e6c5.mp4?t=1786669597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snowed Under</strong> is a first-person game about shoveling snow in the mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig deeper and deeper through the snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you find buried beneath it? Food? Buildings? Or something else entirely…?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened in this place? What is about to happen? And what will you think when you uncover the truth…?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Play Time:</strong> 2–4 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Snow Shoveling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through the snow and make your way toward the steel tower. Keep moving forward. Keep digging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/1f6aace49ddd3a47ee3e08ec049db4ed.poster.avif?t=1786669597\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/1f6aace49ddd3a47ee3e08ec049db4ed.webm?t=1786669597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938200/extras/1f6aace49ddd3a47ee3e08ec049db4ed.mp4?t=1786669597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Shovel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use scrap materials found beneath the snow to upgrade your shovel and improve your digging efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=